++2. 读 `docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_INDEX.md`（路由）+ `docs/DEVELOPMENT_WORKFLOW.md`（流程与文档同步规则）。
++3. 冲突裁决按 `docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_INDEX.md §2`：migration+代码+测试 > 架构事实 > API/DB >
