++# Governance Source Provenance
++
++The AI governance trees in this repository are sourced byte-identical from the
++backend control repository and must NOT be edited locally.
++
++- Source repository: `frontend-governance-control`
++- Source baseline commit: `563e84a573426800b3f6aa8e4e0525bc5314b3a8`
++- Byte-identical set (do not edit locally):
++  - `.agents/` (canonical skills, schema, manifest, skill-evals)
++  - `.zcode/` (agents, commands, config.json) — excluding session-local `.zcode/plans/`
++  - `scripts/` (governance `.mjs` scripts and tests) — excluding `scripts/sync-governance-from-source.mjs`
++  - `.claude/skills/` (generated mirror of `.agents/skills/`)
++- Hand-authored, NOT byte-copied (frontend-specific):
++  - `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/**`, `GOVERNANCE_SOURCE.md`, `.gitignore`
++
++Regeneration is performed exclusively via:
++
++```
++node scripts/sync-governance-from-source.mjs --source <control-repo-path> --baseline 563e84a
++```
++
++The `.claude/skills/` mirror is regenerated by `scripts/sync-ai-skills.mjs`, which the
++sync script invokes automatically. To verify byte-equality without writing:
++
++```
++node scripts/sync-governance-from-source.mjs --check --source <control-repo-path> --baseline 563e84a
++```
++
++Any local edit to the byte-identical set is a governance drift violation and will be
++rejected by `scripts/sync-governance-from-source.mjs --check`.
